          "visual": "The wireframe from the previous scene instantly fills with high-fidelity graphics, text, and colors, revealing a professional website for a programming language. A yellow 'GET STARTED' button is prominent on the right. The color palette includes teal, yellow, and grey. The transition is a sharp cut representing the 'rendering' of the page.",
          "shot_type": "Medium Shot",
